OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and largely sunny day
OL,6,Ftoday with just a little high cloud
OL,7,Fdeveloping during the afternoon.
OL,8,FFeeling hot, although sea breezes
OL,9,Foffering some relief.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and very warm evening
OL,12,Fwith plenty of late sunshine.
OL,13,FOvernight some cloud may spill into
OL,14,Fthe west but largely clear elsewhere.
OL,15,FA warm and uncomfortable night to come.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FA warm and sunny start, but
OL,18,Fcloud tending to increase throughout
OL,19,Fthe day making the sunshine hazy. A
OL,20,Ffew showers also possibly developing
OL,21,Fin the west. Feeling a little cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
