OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry throughout the weekend with some
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Monday is likely to
OL,8,Fremain dry although rain may move in
OL,9,Flater. Feeling cooler as temperatures
OL,10,Freturn to nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
